OL,3,GNEWSAWoman leads trek across Sahara in
OL,4,Ahusband's memory
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lost her husband to a rare
OL,7,Fform of cancer has trekked 100km (62
OL,8,Fmiles) across the Sahara Desert in his
OL,9,Fmemory.
OL,11,FRuth Stephenson, from Anlaby, near
OL,12,FHull, lost her husband Lou to
OL,13,Fleiomyosarcoma ` a rare and aggressive
OL,14,Fform of sarcoma, which affects muscle
OL,15,Ftissue, in October 2025.
OL,17,FHer sister and three friends joined the
OL,18,Ffour-day walk across the desert, which
OL,19,Fshe described as "incredible" and
OL,20,F"heartbreaking".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
