OL,3,GNEWSAWoman leads trek across Sahara in
OL,4,Ahusband's memory
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuth said: "With it being a rare
OL,7,Fcancer, it is not a cancer charity that
OL,8,Fyou see a lot of, it's to support those
OL,9,Fpeople. So, it means more than anything
OL,10,Fthat we are able to do it in Lou's
OL,11,Fmemory and if we help one family that
OL,12,Fis good enough for me."
